# Incremental build state. Machine-specific and rewritten on every build; the
# `tsconfig.lib.` one was already ignored but the plain one was not, so nine of
# them were tracked and churned on each commit.
*.tsbuildinfo

# Declarations emitted for the vite configs themselves. Generated, not source,
# and not shipped by any package's `files` — but they sat outside dist/, so the
# rules above never caught them and 14 were tracked across 7 libs.
vite.config.d.mts
vite.config.d.mts.map

